feat(release): v1.6.1 - enhance login UX and add bulk barcode printing

Authentication (Keyboard Navigation):
- Smart Navigation: Pressing Enter on 'Username' now moves focus to 'Password'.
- Enter-to-Login: Pressing Enter triggers login only if fields are valid.
- Initial Focus: Cursor automatically targets the 'Username' field on startup.
- Validation: Prevent login attempts if fields are empty.

Reception & Barcodes:
- Implemented 'Print All' button in ReceptionDialog for mass generation.
- Added `BulkBarcodeSelectionDialog` to select/deselect items before printing.
- Added separator label logic to distinguish between product batches.
- Connected table double-click event to trigger item modification mode.